{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_failuredetector", "label": "FailureDetector", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "Eine Zustandsmaschine pro Peer (healthy / unreachable / down) auf Basis abgelaufener Zeitschwellen, ohne Tracking statistischer Varianz \u2014 ausreichend fuer LAN-Skala.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_phiaccrualfailuredetector", "label": "PhiAccrualFailureDetector", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "Varianzbewusst und adaptiv, eine oeffentlich exportierte Klasse \u2014 aber noch nicht als auswaehlbarer Detector eingebunden, der Cluster faehrt immer den einfachen FailureDetector, die failureDetector-Option stellt nur dessen Schwellwerte.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_implicit_heartbeats", "label": "Heartbeats sind implizit", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Es gibt keine separaten Ping-Nachrichten \u2014 jeder Cluster-Verkehr setzt den Last-Seen-Timestamp zurueck, also bekommt ein gespraechiger Cluster bessere Failure Detection und ein leerlaufender haengt ganz an Gossip.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_thresholds", "label": "heartbeatIntervalMs / unreachableAfterMs / downAfterMs", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Defaults 500 / 2000 / 5000 ms ergeben ein 2-Sekunden-Erkennungs- und ein 5-Sekunden-Entscheidungsfenster; ueber Regionen hinweg alle drei erhoehen, denn bei 100 ms RTT ist ein verpasster Heartbeat normales Rauschen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_flap_tolerance", "label": "Flap-Toleranzfenster", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Das Verhaeltnis downAfterMs zu unreachableAfterMs (Standard rund 2.5x) ist die Spanne, in der sich ein als unreachable markierter Peer zurueck auf healthy erholen kann, ohne downed zu werden.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_reachabilitychanged", "label": "ReachabilityChanged", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "Das eigene Urteil des lokalen Detectors, ohne die zwei Einschraenkungen von MemberUnreachable; es feuert nur bei Uebergaengen, kippt bei unreachableAfterMs und ist damit die frueheste Warnung \u2014 traegt aber keine Observer-Menge, weil Gossip nur eine flache Member-Liste fuehrt.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_memberunreachable", "label": "MemberUnreachable", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "Ein Mitgliedschaftsuebergang, kein lokales Urteil: es feuert auch fuer einen Peer, von dem jemand anderes nichts mehr hoert, und nur fuer ein Member, das up war.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_lan_defaults", "label": "Defaults sind LAN-Defaults", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Cluster ueber Regionen brauchen 5-10 Sekunden fuer unreachableAfterMs; zu enge Schwellwerte erzeugen Fehlalarme bei kurzem GC, der Cluster reagiert, und bis die GC fertig ist, hat sich das Routing schon verschoben.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_signal_not_action", "label": "Der Detector ist das Signal, nicht die Aktion", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Eine down-Entscheidung entfernt den Peer nicht; die Entfernung laeuft durch die Downing-Strategie, ohne die eine down-Entscheidung nur beratend bleibt und Mitglieder zwischen unreachable und down flattern.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_failuredetector", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_thresholds", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_implicit_heartbeats", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_failuredetector", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_flap_tolerance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_thresholds", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_lan_defaults", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_thresholds", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_reachabilitychanged", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_failuredetector", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_reachabilitychanged", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_memberunreachable", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_phiaccrualfailuredetector", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_failuredetector", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_signal_not_action", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_failuredetector", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/failure-detector.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_failure_detector_signal_not_action", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_downing_strategies_downingprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_s